    require longer retention.
    The legal basis is Article 6(1)(f) GDPR, my legitimate
    interest in handling inquiries and maintaining
    project correspondence.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>

  <p>
    Under the GDPR, you may request access to, correction
    or deletion of your personal data, or restriction
